%% Sequence Diagram: Youth Account Parental Fund Management
sequenceDiagram
  participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
  participant WebApp as Web Application
  participant API as Youth Account API
  participant AccSvc as Account Service
  participant TxnSvc as Transaction Service
  participant PaySvc as Payment Service
  participant NotifSvc as Notification Service
  participant YDB as Youth Account DB

  %% Dashboard Retrieval
  Parent->>WebApp: Login, view dashboard
  WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard (OAuth2)
  API->>AccSvc: Validate ownership, fetch balance
  API->>YDB: Get spending limit
  API->>TxnSvc: Get recent transactions
  API-->>WebApp: Dashboard data
  WebApp-->>Parent: Render dashboard

  %% Fund Transfer
  Parent->>WebApp: Initiate fund transfer
  WebApp->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
  API->>AccSvc: Validate source, check balance
  API->>PaySvc: Execute transfer
  API->>YDB: Update balance
  API->>NotifSvc: Send notification
  API-->>WebApp: Transfer result
  WebApp-->>Parent: Show transfer status

  %% Set Spending Limit
  Parent->>WebApp: Set/Update spending limit
  WebApp->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
  API->>YDB: Update weekly limit
  API->>NotifSvc: Notify update
  API-->>WebApp: Limit updated
  WebApp-->>Parent: Show confirmation

  %% Transaction History
  Parent->>WebApp: View transaction history
  WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions
  API->>TxnSvc: Fetch transactions
  API-->>WebApp: Transaction list
  WebApp-->>Parent: Display transactions
